stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Queued
  Queued --> Working: worker picks up
  Working --> Blocked: needs guardian input
  Blocked --> Working: answered
  Working --> ReviewReady: result posted
  ReviewReady --> Working: changes requested
  ReviewReady --> Done: accepted
  Working --> Failed: error
  Failed --> Queued: retry
  state Working {
    [*] --> Planning
    Planning --> Acting
    Acting --> Verifying
    Verifying --> Acting: check failed
    Verifying --> [*]
  }
  Done --> [*]
